  "_comment": [
    "TonyFlix home rows. Edit this file, then run: python3 tools/gen_home.py",
    "tab keys must match the skinshortcuts labelID of the main-menu item (home, movies, tvshows).",
    "path: TMDbHelper query string (after '?'); common params are appended automatically.",
    "flags: trakt = only when Trakt is linked; lite = also shown on the Lite profile;",
    "style: poster (default, cheapest) or landscape.",
    "Provider IDs (TMDb, US): Netflix 8, Prime Video 9, Hulu 15, Disney+ 337, Apple TV+ 350, Max 1899.",
    "Genre IDs need with_id=True (TMDbHelper otherwise expects genre names).",
    "Row kinds: path (TMDbHelper list), items (static tiles/buttons, no plugin call), stack (results of the focused item in the row above).",
    "Styles: poster, landscape, square (logos), buttons. Relative dates use t-<days> (e.g. primary_release_date.gte=t-120)."
  ],
